    "title": "JMU softball searching for consistency in final weeks of the regular season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jarvis Haren ,\n2 days ago (WHSV) — The struggles continue for James Madison softball. The Dukes are coming off a series loss at Southern Miss, where they dropped two of three. JMU took the series opener and was one out away from securing Game 2 before Southern Miss rallied for two runs while down to its final out, forcing extra innings. The Golden Eagles went on to win 5-4 in 11 innings. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
